xnu 0269: say how much of a swap is the cache clean and how much is the scale

`copy avg` folds the layer copies, the per-swap dcache clean of the source
surface and the canvas scale into one number, which is not enough to choose the
next change. ring231 answered it with this line: `clean avg 736..1008 us` and
`scale avg 9135..13127 us` at canvas 1125x2436 -- the clean is noise and the
scale was the whole cost. The fps line carries both from now on, next to
`copy avg`.

diff --git a/iokit/Kernel/arm/MondrianFramebuffer.cpp b/iokit/Kernel/arm/MondrianFramebuffer.cpp
--- a/iokit/Kernel/arm/MondrianFramebuffer.cpp
+++ b/iokit/Kernel/arm/MondrianFramebuffer.cpp
